flowchart LR
    HL[Hyperliquid public WebSocket] -->|l2Book / trades / bbo / activeAssetCtx| R[Raw recorder]
    R -->|append + flush before parse| RAW[(Hourly framed Zstandard segments)]
    R -->|bounded labels| PROM[Prometheus endpoint :9109]
    R -->|heartbeat| STATE[Atomic recorder state]
    R -. after finalization .-> RC[(Raw DuckDB catalog)]

    RAW --> N[Independent normalizer]
    N -->|verify hashes + footer| VERIFY{Admissible?}
    VERIFY -->|yes| PQ[(Typed Parquet partitions)]
    VERIFY -->|no| Q[(Quarantine)]
    PQ --> NM[Immutable normalized manifests]
    NM --> NC[(Normalized DuckDB catalog)]
    N -->|atomic heartbeat + batch counters| NSTATE[Normalizer state]
    NSTATE --> NHEALTH[Docker normalizer healthcheck]

    T[Tardis datasets] -->|HTTPS + gzip/CSV validation| HIST[(Immutable historical files)]
    HIST --> TC[(Tardis DuckDB catalog)]

    NM --> GATE{Dataset quality policy}
    RC --> GATE
    GATE -->|classified gaps only| RESEARCH[Research and replay loaders]
    GATE -->|unexplained / over limit| REJECT[Reject dataset]

    PRIVATE[Private user feeds] -. account-only liquidation events .-> FUTURE[Phase 4 trading node]
    NOTE[Market-wide liquidations unavailable] --- GATE
